    "notes": "No area/difficulty classification is assigned in this first phase. Problem 10 has an internal timing inconsistency; problem 11 repeats the correct answer in two options. Problems 14 and 15 are solvable under the intended school interpretation, and problem 24 requires the same implicit 'spend all remaining money on the final purchase' assumption seen in similar source items."
